<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Danka Business.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Danka Business.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities named Danka Business Systems Plc as a &quot;Single Best Idea,&quot; a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Prudential reiterated a &quot;buy&quot; rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Danka gained two to 39-1/4 in over-the-counter trading before easing back.</p>
</text>
